  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the coefficients of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;are equal, then</p>"
  },
